 "about_text": "Diane Rosenstein Gallery is a contemporary fine art gallery founded in 2012 by Diane Rosenstein, located in the Hollywood neighborhood of Los Angeles. The gallery represents emerging, midcareer, and established artists working across a wide range of media, including painting, drawing, photography, sculpture, and ceramics. Its program has featured artists such as Eleanor Antin, Julian Stanczak, Amir Zaki, and Terran Last Gun, reflecting an interest in both historical and contemporary practices. The gallery participates regularly in major art fairs, including Independent, Untitled Art, and Art Basel Miami Beach, and its artists' work is frequently reviewed in national art publications.",
